{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3229","id":3601058687,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887Wo8t_","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3229","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3229.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3229.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3229","number":3229,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"policy/v2: add support for policy tests","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tailscale policies have a `tests` block where the operator says, for a given source, what should be reachable. v2 ignored it — a policy whose tests contradicted its own ACLs would still apply.\n\n`SetPolicy` now compiles the new policy in a sandbox, runs the tests, and rejects on failure without touching the live `PolicyManager`. `NewPolicyManager` skips evaluation so a stale stored policy whose referenced user was deleted does not block boot. `headscale policy check` opens the database under `--bypass-grpc-and-access-database-directly` (same flag `set` and `get` already accept) and runs tests against live data.\n\nError messages match Tailscale SaaS so policies move between control planes without rewriting. Comparing against captured SaaS responses surfaced two engine bugs. `Protocol.UnmarshalJSON` stored whichever form the user wrote, so `proto: \"6\", dst: \"host:443\"` was rejected at parse though SaaS accepts it — `UnmarshalJSON` now canonicalises numeric IANA forms to the name. `srcReachesDst` passed empty Protocol through to `ruleMatchesProto`, which short-circuited any rule with an `IPProto` restriction, so a TCP-only grant could not satisfy a default-proto test — empty Protocol now expands to `{TCP, UDP, ICMP, ICMPv6}` at the call site.\n\nParse-time schema validation rejects test shapes SaaS rejects: single-port dst, proto in `{tcp, udp, sctp, \"\"}`, no `autogroup:internet` dst, no CIDR-typed dst, at least one of `accept`/`deny`.\n\nCloses #3005\n\nFixes #1803\n\n> Generated with the help of an AI assistant","created_at":"2026-04-29T08:57:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-12T10:54:55Z","closed_at":"2026-05-12T10:54:55Z","merged_at":"2026-05-12T10:54:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"f03d41ea9a4bd5277ff70f10140bf3afa43a1ddc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","